-- filtering criteria (heavy atoms 10-15, pChEMBL > 10, <5 activities per assay,
-- <2 duplicates, non-null standard_value).  To prepare for UUID generation,
-- we need each activity’s canonical SMILES.  We therefore join ACTIVITIES_30
-- (for the activity rows) with COMPOUND_STRUCTURES_30 (for the structures) on
