Table full name: EBI_CHEMBL.EBI_CHEMBL.ACTIVITIES_30
Column name: potential_duplicate Type: NUMBER Description: When set to 1, indicates that the value is likely to be a repeat citation of a value reported in a previous ChEMBL paper, rather than a new, independent measurement. Note: value of zero does not guarantee that the measurement is novel/independent though
Column name: type Type: TEXT Description: Type of end-point measurement: e.g. IC50, LD50, %inhibition etc, as it appears in the original dataset
Column name: value Type: FLOAT Description: Datapoint value as it appears in the original dataset.
Column name: doc_id Type: NUMBER Description: Foreign key to documents table (for quick lookup of publication details - can also link to documents through compound_records or assays table)
Column name: standard_value Type: FLOAT Description: Same as PUBLISHED_VALUE but transformed to common units: e.g. mM concentrations converted to nM.
Column name: molregno Type: NUMBER Description: Foreign key to compounds table (for quick lookup of compound structure - can also link to compounds through compound_records table)
Column name: pchembl_value Type: FLOAT Description: Negative log of selected concentration-response activity values (IC50/EC50/XC50/AC50/Ki/Kd/Potency)
Column name: activity_id Type: NUMBER Description: Unique ID for the activity row
Column name: assay_id Type: NUMBER Description: Foreign key to the assays table (containing the assay description)
Column name: standard_type Type: TEXT Description:  Standardised version of the published_activity_type (e.g. IC50 rather than Ic-50/Ic50/ic50/ic-50)
Sample rows:
